WEBVTT

00:17.250 --> 00:18.750
GHOST BUSTERZ!

00:17.620 --> 00:20.380
OH! The time has come

00:18.160 --> 00:18.750
BUSTERZ!

00:20.380 --> 00:23.750
To stand up for tomorrow

00:22.710 --> 00:24.170
OH OH OH!

00:23.750 --> 00:26.300
We're ghostbusterz

00:26.300 --> 00:30.970
Breakin' away from the old ghosts

00:30.970 --> 00:34.350
Of history

00:34.350 --> 00:37.730
Breaking free!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

01:15.640 --> 01:20.440
Presented by hwat fansubs

01:17.020 --> 01:18.560
The time has come

01:33.030 --> 01:37.250
The seventh month of 1600 AD, or Keicho 5.

01:37.610 --> 01:41.410
Charging Tokugawa Ieyasu with thirteen articles of impeachment,

01:41.410 --> 01:48.320
Ishida Mitsunari sent messengers to various daimyo in the name of the Toyotomi clan,

01:48.320 --> 01:51.500
telling them to raise armies.

01:51.500 --> 01:56.600
At the same time, beings seeking to end the period of turbulence

01:56.600 --> 02:00.460
and build a kingdom to last a thousand years

02:00.460 --> 02:04.710
were about to awaken from a thousand-year sleep.

02:04.710 --> 02:06.750
And then...

02:06.750 --> 02:10.480
On the fifteenth day of the ninth month, at Sekigahara,

02:10.480 --> 02:12.950
the Eastern Army of Tokugawa Ieyasu clashed with

02:12.950 --> 02:18.080
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and Ishida Mitsunari.

02:18.080 --> 02:21.550
As a result of the performance of Kobayakawa Hideaki's troops,

02:21.550 --> 02:27.460
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and
Ishida Mitsunari achieved a sweeping victory,

02:27.460 --> 02:33.710
bringing what should have been
three hundred years of peace to the world.

02:34.570 --> 02:39.590
You should all be quite familiar with this story...

02:45.850 --> 02:46.820
Hey!

02:46.820 --> 02:51.010
Musashi-dono's faithful underling, Ninjataro here!

02:53.420 --> 02:58.390
In order to receive gun-dou training, Musashi-dono went to Daitokuji,

02:58.390 --> 03:03.340
but the great Master Takuan was unwilling to teach him,

03:03.340 --> 03:06.020
so Musashi-dono was sulking.

03:07.460 --> 03:14.370
Then, a foreign woman named Desperado with <i>biiiig</i> boobies showed up at Daitokuji!

03:15.510 --> 03:18.770
Desperado was actually being possessed by an ayakashi,

03:18.770 --> 03:22.230
and it tried to kill Musashi-dono!

03:22.950 --> 03:26.180
The onmyoudan and Ronin's Meiretsu blade didn't work on it.

03:26.180 --> 03:29.610
The Spider Queen has Musashi-dono in a tight spot!

03:29.610 --> 03:32.410
This is kind of... <i>very</i> dangerous!

04:03.590 --> 04:08.390
Gun-ki,
The Demon Gun

04:20.360 --> 04:21.440
Holy crap!

04:22.990 --> 04:24.630
This is a pain.

04:24.630 --> 04:29.010
You keep chasing me everywhere, and now this!

04:29.020 --> 04:30.700
It's not me!

04:30.700 --> 04:32.620
My body is moving on its own!

04:35.460 --> 04:38.290
I said it was pointless, did I not?

04:39.980 --> 04:43.640
Musashi, get me out of here!

04:50.720 --> 04:51.900
Oh no you don't!

04:51.900 --> 04:54.370
Don't spit that stuff at me!

04:54.880 --> 04:57.230
The Spider Queen's demon strings...

04:57.230 --> 05:02.050
They say those threads can control humans like puppets.

05:02.050 --> 05:04.530
So the rumors were true...

05:06.400 --> 05:08.490
Not only do the onmyoudan not work,

05:08.490 --> 05:11.390
but it's putting me up against someone I don't want to fight!

05:11.390 --> 05:13.600
Musashi! Aim for the threads!

05:13.600 --> 05:15.090
Thanks, Ronin!

05:16.780 --> 05:18.920
Please, stop me!

05:18.920 --> 05:21.020
What's going on with my body?

05:26.520 --> 05:27.940
Damn it!

05:38.980 --> 05:41.400
Stop it!

05:41.400 --> 05:43.470
Why?

05:43.470 --> 05:45.870
You wanted to kill this man, did you not?

05:45.870 --> 05:49.030
I am simply helping you.

05:50.550 --> 05:54.820
I want to defeat him with my own power.

05:55.210 --> 05:57.280
I don't need your help,

05:57.280 --> 05:59.380
so get rid of these strings!

06:00.790 --> 06:02.980
That is impossible.

06:02.980 --> 06:05.990
There is a clear difference in strength between you and Musashi.

06:05.990 --> 06:09.650
That is why I'm helping you.

06:09.650 --> 06:12.430
I don't need you to judge that!

06:14.530 --> 06:17.050
I don't want to fight like this!

06:21.350 --> 06:23.790
Isn't there something we can do?

06:23.790 --> 06:25.490
All I can do is run.

06:25.720 --> 06:28.970
This fight will never end.

06:28.970 --> 06:31.760
Wait, try putting Desperado to sleep.

06:32.420 --> 06:34.420
Oh right, I have <i>that</i>.

06:34.980 --> 06:36.720
What are you gonna do?

06:49.800 --> 06:51.490
What are you doing?

06:51.490 --> 06:54.450
Be good and sleep for a little while.

07:01.480 --> 07:03.660
Stupid, don't dodge!

07:03.660 --> 07:05.650
Anyone would dodge!

07:05.650 --> 07:07.820
This is to help you!

07:07.820 --> 07:10.210
Don't worry, these are sleep bullets.

07:11.880 --> 07:14.160
I don't want to get shot.

07:31.170 --> 07:32.470
Well done.

07:33.220 --> 07:34.970
Finally over.

07:34.970 --> 07:36.780
Stay on guard.

07:37.190 --> 07:40.240
The Spider Queen is still there, do not forget.

07:41.220 --> 07:42.770
Exactly.

07:42.770 --> 07:48.860
And look, sleep is no problem for this girl.

08:12.660 --> 08:14.030
What's going on?

08:14.030 --> 08:17.030
Desperado's shooting at me, even though she's asleep!

08:17.030 --> 08:19.020
Do not forget, Musashi-dono.

08:19.540 --> 08:23.670
The Spider Queen controls humans with strings.

08:24.980 --> 08:27.780
Desperado's lack of consciousness is inconsequential—

08:27.780 --> 08:32.290
no, in fact, it makes her easier to control.

08:32.290 --> 08:34.290
Quite right.

08:58.220 --> 09:01.720
I guess there's nothing to do but
take out the monster's main body.

09:08.820 --> 09:10.420
No good?

09:18.200 --> 09:20.260
Meiretsu is also no good?

09:22.010 --> 09:27.380
If onmyoudan and Ronin's sword
don't work, how do we fight it?

09:27.380 --> 09:30.330
If we had that man...

09:31.020 --> 09:33.650
Master Takuan, who do you speak of?

09:34.440 --> 09:37.110
An old friend of mine.

09:37.430 --> 09:38.740
That cart...

09:38.740 --> 09:41.100
Haven't we seen that before?

09:43.220 --> 09:45.370
Sarutobi Sasuke?

09:45.900 --> 09:48.040
So that means it's Dabinoji?

09:48.040 --> 09:53.500
Musashi, you can't defeat the spider by conventional methods, you know.

09:53.500 --> 09:54.810
What?

09:54.810 --> 09:58.480
Oh, Dabinoji, I was waiting.

09:58.480 --> 10:01.510
Why is the inventor here?

10:01.940 --> 10:06.650
Oh, I thought I could smell some nice business to be had.

10:14.060 --> 10:15.750
Old Man Dabinoji...

10:16.410 --> 10:21.570
If you have something special that can beat this monster, tell me!

10:21.570 --> 10:23.180
How much can you pay?

10:23.940 --> 10:28.490
Looking to profit even in this situation? You opportunist!

10:29.490 --> 10:31.650
That's how I do business.

10:31.650 --> 10:33.630
Damn it, two ryo, then!

10:33.630 --> 10:39.110
Well, that's a non-starter. We're talking about the life of your <i>girlfriend</i> here.

10:39.820 --> 10:41.790
Girl<i>what</i>?

10:42.420 --> 10:44.350
It means 'lover'.

10:44.350 --> 10:46.120
Don't joke.

10:46.890 --> 10:50.060
Where do you see love in this?

10:50.060 --> 10:51.810
Don't be shy.

10:51.810 --> 10:53.770
I'm not being shy!

10:55.660 --> 10:57.420
What now?

10:57.420 --> 10:59.850
Fine! Five ryo!

10:59.850 --> 11:02.020
Should we go home, Sasuke?

11:02.900 --> 11:04.240
Ten ryo!

11:04.240 --> 11:06.180
Sasuke, we're going home.

11:07.150 --> 11:10.060
Alright, alright! Twenty ryo!

11:10.870 --> 11:14.030
I'll throw in a little bonus.

11:22.630 --> 11:24.990
Musashi! Take this!

11:27.550 --> 11:29.040
Those bullets!

11:29.380 --> 11:32.350
Onmyoudan... no, something else.

11:32.350 --> 11:34.490
They're called <i>enkaboudan</i>.

11:34.490 --> 11:38.310
Fiery bullets from traditions deep within China, in Mongolia...

11:38.650 --> 11:41.400
I don't care where they come from.

11:41.400 --> 11:45.240
What matters is whether or not it can beat that ayakashi!

11:46.780 --> 11:49.850
Wait! Let me finish my explanation!

11:49.850 --> 11:52.410
No time for that shit.

11:54.270 --> 11:55.980
Musashi, wait!

11:56.250 --> 12:00.290
I'll listen to you while I beat this thing!

12:00.980 --> 12:03.260
No time for your long explanations now!

12:03.260 --> 12:04.720
Take this!

12:22.180 --> 12:25.350
Oh, the demon threads are burning away! They're melting!

12:25.930 --> 12:30.350
Even though onmyoudan and Meiretsu could do nothing, they're melting away!

12:30.350 --> 12:31.650
Amazing!

12:35.820 --> 12:38.490
What is the meaning of this?

12:38.490 --> 12:39.950
Wow.

12:39.950 --> 12:44.620
With these bullets, I can take out that spider!

12:44.620 --> 12:47.500
Musashi, drop the gun right now!

12:47.500 --> 12:48.710
Huh?

12:58.420 --> 13:00.430
Drop the gun!

13:00.430 --> 13:02.300
Huh? What are you talking about?

13:02.300 --> 13:03.470
Hurry up!

13:03.890 --> 13:06.390
Don't be stupid!

13:06.390 --> 13:09.480
I'm gonna use this to get that spider...

13:10.140 --> 13:13.520
Ah! Hot hot hot hot hot!

13:15.650 --> 13:17.150
Oh, dear...

13:17.150 --> 13:18.820
Musashi's gun!

13:18.820 --> 13:21.610
It has returned to scrap iron.

13:21.910 --> 13:24.410
My gun!

13:24.410 --> 13:25.660
My...

13:27.200 --> 13:30.290
Even if your bullets can burn my strings,

13:30.290 --> 13:34.630
it defeats the purpose if the gun also melts.

13:38.010 --> 13:40.470
That's what I was trying to say.

13:41.930 --> 13:43.640
Now, then.

13:43.640 --> 13:49.060
I'm interested in how this will turn out.

13:49.060 --> 13:53.190
All of you will die for me in the end,

13:53.190 --> 13:56.650
so I will watch your final struggles.

13:57.070 --> 14:00.940
I will enjoy the show from high above.

14:02.860 --> 14:05.910
Hey, hey, what are you going to do about this?

14:05.910 --> 14:08.580
You owe me a new gun!

14:08.830 --> 14:14.920
What, it's your fault for not listening to me.

14:14.920 --> 14:16.540
What was that?

14:16.880 --> 14:22.880
Plus, even if I gave you another normal gun, you still can't win!

14:23.340 --> 14:28.350
Or will you shoot another <i>enkaboudan</i> knowing that the gun will melt?

14:30.720 --> 14:38.940
Well, normal guns can only use but a fraction of the enkaboudan's true power.

14:39.530 --> 14:42.440
That was just a fraction?

14:42.440 --> 14:44.410
Then what should I do?

14:44.700 --> 14:45.990
I wonder...

14:45.990 --> 14:51.200
Why don't you try asking that old geezer over there?

14:53.460 --> 14:55.870
Master Takuan, what does he mean?

14:56.580 --> 14:59.800
Dabinoji, are you saying we should use <i>that</i>?

15:00.250 --> 15:02.090
I wonder.

15:05.050 --> 15:06.890
Ta- Takuan-sama!

15:06.890 --> 15:11.220
You can't be planning to unseal the <i>gun-ki</i>?

15:11.680 --> 15:14.020
<i>Gun-ki</i>? Have you heard of it?

15:14.440 --> 15:16.310
Don't ask me.

15:18.650 --> 15:20.480
Master, you must not!

15:20.480 --> 15:25.610
So many gun-dou practitioners have lost their lives using it!

15:28.070 --> 15:33.660
Does Master Takuan really plan to unseal the <i>gun-ki</i>?

15:33.660 --> 15:35.460
That cannot be.

15:35.460 --> 15:40.000
Master Takuan knows the danger better than anyone!

15:40.000 --> 15:45.010
Hey, everyone's been going "<i>gun-ki</i>", "<i>gun-ki</i>", but what is it?

15:45.010 --> 15:46.430
Some kind of food?

15:46.430 --> 15:50.010
There is no need for those unversed in gun-dou customs to know.

15:52.310 --> 15:55.890
The gun-ki, written with the characters for 'gun' and 'demon.'

15:55.890 --> 15:59.350
Only the most exceptional masters of gun-dou are allowed to possess it.

15:59.350 --> 16:01.060
There are only two in the world.

16:01.060 --> 16:04.490
It is the strongest, peerless gun in the world.

16:04.490 --> 16:05.690
Master!

16:06.450 --> 16:08.450
Only two in the world?

16:08.450 --> 16:12.030
Strongest, peerless?

16:13.490 --> 16:19.920
Bullets fired from the gun-ki have a hundred times more power than normal,

16:19.920 --> 16:23.170
and it can fire any type of bullet.

16:23.170 --> 16:26.470
Truly the strongest gun in the world.

16:30.180 --> 16:31.430
It cannot be...

16:33.180 --> 16:38.060
I've asked him over and over to give it to me,

16:38.060 --> 16:43.230
but he kept lying that there was no such thing.

16:43.230 --> 16:46.900
He wouldn't take any offer of mine.

16:47.360 --> 16:50.660
You're saying that this gun is in the temple?

16:57.700 --> 16:59.160
Gun-ki...

17:02.830 --> 17:05.420
Master Takuan, it's here, right?

17:05.840 --> 17:11.680
With that gun, I could fire the
bullets the inventor gave me, right?

17:11.680 --> 17:13.100
Most likely.

17:13.100 --> 17:14.430
Master!

17:16.470 --> 17:18.810
Why won't you use it?

17:18.810 --> 17:22.310
It's the only thing that can beat that ayakashi.

17:22.310 --> 17:24.520
Why don't you use it?

17:24.520 --> 17:26.320
It is sealed.

17:26.320 --> 17:27.360
Sealed?

17:27.360 --> 17:30.990
In the past, many gun-dou practitioners have obtained the gun-ki.

17:31.410 --> 17:34.410
The gun-ki is said to be the strongest gun,

17:34.410 --> 17:40.080
capable of shooting through steel and sending ayakashi back to hell.

17:40.080 --> 17:43.880
They say the holder can even conquer the world.

17:44.170 --> 17:50.220
However, most have been engulfed by the power that sleeps within the gun-ki,

17:50.220 --> 17:55.550
ceasing to be human, continuing to shoot in chaos,

17:55.550 --> 17:58.470
destroying both man and beast.

17:58.470 --> 18:00.060
And in the end...

18:01.230 --> 18:02.770
they became demons...

18:04.770 --> 18:07.110
...and died.

18:07.110 --> 18:09.480
The gun-ki, true to its name, is a demon gun.

18:09.780 --> 18:12.400
That is why it is sealed.

18:12.990 --> 18:14.200
Master...

18:17.240 --> 18:19.410
What about you, Master?

18:20.580 --> 18:22.080
You who spread gun-dou far and wide,

18:22.080 --> 18:25.130
mastered gun-dou faster than anyone...

18:25.130 --> 18:29.920
There is no doubt that you have held the gun-ki!

18:29.920 --> 18:33.260
If I were younger, I might have used it,

18:33.260 --> 18:39.140
but as I am now, I would become a demon and sooner choose my own death.

18:45.060 --> 18:48.860
I cannot allow the use of the gun-ki, in the end.

18:52.740 --> 18:54.700
That is good.

18:54.700 --> 18:57.070
Though I almost wanted to see it myself,

18:57.070 --> 18:59.950
that legendary gun they call gun-ki.

19:08.840 --> 19:14.550
But I will have all of you die right here and now after all!

19:30.520 --> 19:32.230
Oh, no!

19:47.250 --> 19:49.330
Death to all!

20:23.540 --> 20:26.160
Good luck, all of you.

20:31.960 --> 20:35.300
Come now, meet your demise!

20:37.420 --> 20:39.550
This is a tight spot!

20:39.550 --> 20:40.720
Master!

20:40.720 --> 20:42.050
What?

20:42.050 --> 20:44.970
You know what I'm going to say!

20:44.970 --> 20:45.810
No!

20:46.140 --> 20:48.560
Then everyone will die!

20:48.980 --> 20:50.230
But...

20:52.310 --> 20:54.020
You can feel it in your heart, can't you?

20:54.020 --> 20:58.900
That Musashi of all people might be able to use it?

20:59.820 --> 21:02.990
I will definitely not become a demon.

21:05.700 --> 21:07.120
I'm begging you.

21:07.120 --> 21:09.000
Let me use the gun-ki.

21:09.000 --> 21:10.750
I've said no!

21:18.050 --> 21:19.300
Watch out!

21:46.910 --> 21:48.040
Very well.

21:48.750 --> 21:50.960
I shall bet on you.

21:51.750 --> 21:53.880
So you will...

21:56.500 --> 22:00.130
So, where is that gun sealed?

22:00.130 --> 22:01.470
Right here.

22:01.470 --> 22:05.180
Of course, I know it's somewhere in the temple.

22:05.180 --> 22:06.890
But where exactly?

22:06.890 --> 22:09.020
I said, it's right here.

22:09.020 --> 22:09.850
Huh?

22:30.580 --> 22:34.420
Your arm... is a fake?

22:34.420 --> 22:37.880
The gun-ki is inside my body.

22:46.180 --> 22:48.640
This is the gun-ki.

22:57.190 --> 22:58.520
Musashi!

22:58.520 --> 22:59.900
No time to stand still!

22:59.900 --> 23:01.360
Hurry up!

23:01.360 --> 23:02.530
Alright!

23:02.780 --> 23:04.650
Yes, take it!

23:19.920 --> 23:21.000
Musashi!

23:21.760 --> 23:23.380
Are you alright?

23:47.110 --> 23:50.450
So... he has obtained the gun-ki...

23:58.540 --> 24:01.290
In my natural, unadorned style,

24:01.290 --> 24:04.130
I'll tell you these feelings of mine

24:04.130 --> 24:09.470
Together to the sky past the darkness!

24:09.470 --> 24:14.640
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

24:16.180 --> 24:21.270
Baby, we'll send time flowing forward just a little,

24:21.270 --> 24:27.490
and we'll embrace even the harsh gusts of wind

24:27.490 --> 24:32.780
with sympathy for pointless worries

24:32.780 --> 24:36.910
and a melody that will overcome the pain

24:39.290 --> 24:49.680
If the poison of the flower that bloomed in my cupped hands

24:49.680 --> 25:00.600
has managed to pierce through the center of my heart...

25:00.600 --> 25:03.360
In my natural, unadorned style,

25:03.360 --> 25:06.230
I'll tell you these feelings of mine,

25:06.230 --> 25:11.820
Unraveling this puzzle of the heart

25:11.820 --> 25:14.620
I'll bring out every part

25:14.620 --> 25:17.580
of your unchanging style

25:17.580 --> 25:22.920
Together to the sky past the darkness!

25:22.920 --> 25:28.050
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

25:29.630 --> 25:32.590
What's with this messed-up world?

25:32.590 --> 25:34.970
I'm don't know about all this gun-ki stuff,

25:34.970 --> 25:38.100
but I won't become a demon!

25:38.100 --> 25:45.520
The next chapter: <i>The Path of the Demon</i>!
